{"_v":1,"id":"beetlejuice-2022","cs":79.15,"rc":8,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":1,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Giselle","o":"The Stage","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":1,"q":"Simply, Beetlejuice is fun, fun, FUN!"},{"cn":"Aly Prouty","o":"Spectrum News 1","s":82,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://spectrumnews1.com/wi/milwaukee/news/2024/10/01/beetlejuice-review-milwaukee-marcus-center","d":"2024-10-01","q":"“Beetlejuice” is full of talented people on and off the stage, and its technical elements put this Broadway tour over the top."},{"cn":"Maria Cortes Gonzalez","o":"El Paso Times","s":81,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.elpasotimes.com/story/entertainment/things-to-do/2024/11/27/beetlejuice-thrills-el-paso-fans-plaza-theatre-get-tickets-performances-through-dec-1/76619764007/","d":"2024-11-27","q":"And for anyone who has ever bought a Girl Scout box of cookies, or been a Girl Scout ― the Girl Scout number with a girl who can literally be scared to death is fun and another highlight of a fabulous show."},{"cn":"Margaret Smith","o":"Telegram","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.telegram.com/story/entertainment/theater/2024/01/05/haunted-hilarious-and-heartfelt-beetlejuice-captivates-mortals/72118671007/","d":"2024-01-05","q":"Every performer, from the main cast to the ensemble dancers, gleams with electric energy, with each step and each line delivered with razor-sharp timing."},{"cn":"Sebastian Perez-Navarro","o":"The Prospector","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.theprospectordaily.com/2024/12/03/beetlejuice-musical-theatre-performance-art/","d":"2024-12-03","q":"What Beetlejuice the musical provides is an alternate medium to telling Burton’s unhinged story."},{"cn":"Jordana Rosenfeld","o":"Pittsburgh City Paper","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://www.pghcitypaper.com/news-2/contents-under-pressure-1337339/?oid=23389887","q":"Esler, making her professional debut, has just recently graduated high school, and soars through a very demanding score wi